     Read: ratio > 1 means fp32 DRAM streaming outruns the ternary kernel even fully streamed --
     consistent with the LUT kernel still being compute-bound at donor width, i.e. denser packing
     would NOT buy bandwidth headroom (ADAPTER_MEMO_01 sec.2.4). ratio <= 1 (ternary at/above fp32)
     would mean the LUT path has become bandwidth-bound, and denser packing becomes the ~2.5x lever.
     THIS RATIO, NOT AN ASSUMPTION, DECIDES IT.

